  "description": "Given an array of distinct integers, count the number of tuples (a, b, c, d) such that a * b = c * d where a, b, c, and d are distinct elements.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. map = {}\n2. count = 0\n3. for i = 0 to n-1\n4.   for j = i + 1 to n-1\n5.     prod = nums[i] * nums[j]\n6.     count += 8 * map[prod] || 0\n7.     map[prod] = (map[prod] || 0) + 1",
